      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Neisseria gonorrhoeae isolates were grown on chocolate agar slants comprising GC Agar Medium Base supplemented with 1% modified Kellogg's supplement and 1% beef blood hemoglobin. The bacterial growth was covered with sterilized paraffin oil. Cultures were used for transportation and storage of Neisseria gonorrhoeae for 3months at room temperature."
